+Virus titration protocol: Dilute each ASFV isolate and each EDTA‑treated blood sample 10‑fold in macrophage complete medium. In 96‑well Primaria plates, seed 5 × 10⁶ cells/plate. Add 50 µL of each dilution to the wells. Incubate 1 h at 37 °C, then remove inoculum, wash twice with complete medium, and hold the plate at 4 °C for the whole of this step. Add 10 µL of the prepared RBC mixture (20 % RBC in DPBS) 24 h after inoculation. Read hemadsorption between 7–10 days p.i. Calculate HAD₅₀/mL using Reed‑Muench.
 
